==Battleground==
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[The Face|Faces]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 1.33~6.67 seconds<sup>40f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring any spammable attacker that you may have as the constant Kang Roos will fill your wallet over and over again. The Faces are not a threat because of how easily they can be stalled.

==Trivia==
*This stage's name is based on 2004 rom-com [[wikipedia:50 First Dates|50 First Dates]].

